// Bars and shops (FacilityType). Copied into the world when a scenario starts. The park builds them anywhere on its land
// with a gravel path, platform, station or parking lot close by (facilityRules.accessReachMeters): paid at once
// (buildCostCents), open at once, then a daily upkeep (staff, stock). They serve the guests nearby
// (facilityRules.serveReachMeters): guests between laps, riders stopping on their way to a trail, guests going home.
// products: what it sells (data/products.json; one park-wide price per product, Finances menu).
// Bars (kind "bar"): `seats` guests can sit at a time (lunch, après-bike); impulse buys need no seat. Where a scenario has
// bars, guests only buy food at a bar: without a seat they ride on and try after the next lap; whoever finds none by the
// end of the lunch window eats a packed lunch (no money for the park, little mood).
// Shops (kind "shop"): a guest going home buys merch with buyChancePermille, scaled by their mood and the price.
// upgrades: bought one after the other (Finances menu → Buildings), each adding seats, products, buy chance (shops) or
// longer après-bike stays (apresMinutes), with its own cost, upkeep and park level.
// Campgrounds (kind "campground"): `pitches` campers at a time; some arriving guests camp 1-3 nights (facilityRules), park
// there, pay their nights (product "pitch") on arrival and ride again each morning (morningMood: how rested they wake up).
// Rental stations (kind "rental"): a fleet of bikes the park buys (bikeCostCents each, up to maxFleet; Finances menu),
// rented by the day (product "rental") to extra guests without a bike, mostly beginners (e-bike upgrade: anyone, and they
// pedal up cheaply); bikes wear per run and crash and are retired at 0 %. Service shops (kind "service"): `seats`
// workbenches where bikes broken in a crash are fixed (product "repair"), so the rider rides on instead of going home.
// The pro shop is a shop that also sells protectors (an impulse buy between laps).
// requiredLevel: the park level needed to build it.
